  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORAD Economic Justice project in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Norwegian Agency for Development Cooperation (NORAD) funded Economic Justice Project seeks to strengthen citizen -led, evidence -based advocacy for progressive and equitable tax reform in Kenya. The project will develop policy proposals on wealth and High Net Worth Individual taxation, convene dialogue with Treasury, Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) and Parliament, support investigative journalism, and mobilise public engagement through the &quot;Fair Share for Kenya&quot; campaign. It will link national advocacy to regional and global tax processes to advance transparent, gender -responsive and accountable fiscal governance.</narrative>
  </description>
